bottomparticipants

actor Admin
boundary "Admin Dashboard UI" as UI
boundary Router
control UserController
control AccessTokenGuard
control RolesGuard
control UserService
entity ":UserModel" as UserModel
database MongoDB

Admin -> UI: 1. Load Dashboard (Users Statistics)
activate Admin
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /user/admin/recent?limit=5
activate Router

Router -> AccessTokenGuard: 3. canActivate(request)
activate AccessTokenGuard

opt Token invalid
  AccessTokenGuard --> Router: 3.1. Deny
  Router --> UI: 3.2. 401 Unauthorized
  UI --> Admin: 3.3. Show error message
end

AccessTokenGuard --> Router: 4. Allow
deactivate AccessTokenGuard

Router -> RolesGuard: 5. checkRole(ADMIN)
activate RolesGuard

opt Role invalid
  RolesGuard --> Router: 5.1. Deny
  Router --> UI: 5.2. 403 Forbidden
  UI --> Admin: 5.3. Show error message
end

RolesGuard --> Router: 6. Allow
deactivate RolesGuard

Router -> UserController: 7. getRecentUsers(limit=5)
activate UserController

UserController -> UserService: 8. getRecentUsers(limit)
activate UserService

UserService -> UserModel: 9. find().sort().limit().lean()
activate UserModel
UserModel -> MongoDB: 10. query recent users
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserModel: 11. docs
deactivate MongoDB
UserModel --> UserService: 12. docs
deactivate UserModel

UserService -> UserService: 13. map to response DTO
activate UserService
space
deactivate UserService

UserService --> UserController: 14. recentRows
deactivate UserService

UserController --> Router: 15. HTTP 200 response
deactivate UserController

Router --> UI: 16. Return recent users
deactivate Router
UI --> Admin: 17. Display users statistics
deactivate UI
deactivate Admin